illions who trust Life360 for their location sharing needs.<br><br>https://www.life360.com/privacy_policy/<br>https://www.life360.com/terms_of_use/<br><br>Disclaimer: Continued usage of location sharing services while the app is in the background can excessively drain battery. But not to worry, we\u2019ve spent 10 years developing our location technology and our algorithms always keep battery usage to a minimum, even while you drive!",
